# Usage

Call run(data) with input matching manifest.json input_schema.

## Input schema

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "file_path": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Path to the CSV file to be validated."
    },
    "required_headers": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "description": "List of required headers that must be present in the CSV file."
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "file_path",
    "required_headers"
  ]
}
```

